# Shell scripts and the Dockerfile are copied into a Linux image. With CRLF
# line endings the shebang resolves to "/bin/sh\r" and the container fails to
# start, which happens on Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true. Pin them
# to LF so the image builds the same way on every platform.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
